      "start": "1885-05-20",
      "end": "1934-05-01"
     },
     "periodStartPrecision": "day",
     "periodEndPrecision": "day",
     "heading": {
      "zh-Hant": "出身與奧地利時期",
      "en": "Origins and the Austrian years"
     },
     "body": {
      "zh-Hant": "勒爾1885年5月20日生於特爾努塞維林（今羅馬尼亞），畢業於維也納新城的特蕾莎軍事學院，1906年以少尉身分分發步兵第85團。奧地利期間他1934年晉升少將，並在同年5月1日被任命為「空中防護」部隊的指揮官；該部隊後來改稱空軍部隊。",
      "en": "Löhr was born on 20 May 1885 in Turnu Severin, now in Romania. He graduated from the Theresian Military Academy in Wiener Neustadt and in 1906 was commissioned as a lieutenant in Infantry Regiment 85. In Austria he became a major general in 1934 and on 1 May 1934 was appointed commander of the 'Luftschutz' air force formation, which was later renamed the air forces."
     },
