    {
     "ord": 2,
     "period": {
      "start": "1934-05-01",
      "end": "1939-04-01"
     },
     "periodStartPrecision": "day",
     "periodEndPrecision": "day",
     "heading": {
      "zh-Hant": "奧地利空軍與併入德國空軍",
      "en": "Austrian air forces and transfer to the Luftwaffe"
     },
     "body": {
      "zh-Hant": "勒爾擔任奧地利空軍部隊指揮官，推動飛行部隊的擴建。1938年3月14日，他以中將身分被併入德國國防軍；來源指出，他之所以進入德國空軍，是由於國務秘書米爾希的推薦。",
      "en": "Löhr, as commander of the Austrian air forces, pushed forward the buildup of the flying troops. On 14 March 1938 he was taken into the German Wehrmacht as a lieutenant general; one source says he entered the Luftwaffe on the recommendation of State Secretary Erhard Milch."
     },
