    {
     "ord": 3,
     "period": {
      "start": "1939-04-01",
      "end": "1942-08-01"
     },
     "periodStartPrecision": "day",
     "periodEndPrecision": "month",
     "heading": {
      "zh-Hant": "第四航空艦隊與閃擊波蘭",
      "en": "Luftflotte 4 and the Polish campaign"
     },
     "body": {
      "zh-Hant": "1939年4月1日起，勒爾以航空兵上將身分出任第四航空艦隊司令，駐維也納。美國陸軍戰史記載，1939年5月中旬的作戰計畫中，第四航空軍由他指揮，負責南方集團軍群的作戰區。他的航空艦隊在1939年9月支援波蘭戰役，支援南方集團軍群；1942年7月他被迫把指揮權交給里希特霍芬。",
      "en": "From 1 April 1939 Löhr, as General der Flieger, was chief of Luftflotte 4 in Vienna. The US Army history records that in the mid-May 1939 planning the Fourth Air Force was under his command and was to operate in the area of Army Group South. His air fleet supported the Polish campaign in September 1939 and Army Group South; in July 1942 he had to hand the command over to Richthofen against his will."
     },
