    {
     "ord": 4,
     "period": {
      "start": "1942-07-01",
      "end": "1947-02-27"
     },
     "periodStartPrecision": "month",
     "periodEndPrecision": "day",
     "heading": {
      "zh-Hant": "巴爾幹與戰後審判",
      "en": "The Balkans and trial after the war"
     },
     "body": {
      "zh-Hant": "1942年7月起，勒爾改任第12軍團司令；該軍團自1943年1月1日改稱E集團軍群。1945年3月23日，他接替魏克斯出任東南地區總司令。1946年10月起他在貝爾格勒受戰犯審判，被判處槍決，1947年2月26日在貝爾格勒被處決。",
      "en": "From July 1942 Löhr was commander of the 12th Army, renamed Army Group E on 1 January 1943. On 23 March 1945 he succeeded Weichs as commander-in-chief Southeast. From October 1946 he was tried for war crimes in Belgrade and sentenced to death by shooting; he was executed in Belgrade on 26 February 1947."
     },
